docs {
  ### Send Message
  Sends a chat message in a specific chat room.
  It also automatically updates the room's `updated_at` timestamp and triggers an FCM push notification to the recipient of the message (if their `fcm_token` is present).
  
  #### Path Parameters
  - `roomId` (string, required): The UUID of the chat room.
  
  #### Request Body
  - `content` (string, optional): Text content. Required if no attachment is provided.
  - `attachment_url` (string, optional): Public CDN URL of the uploaded file.
  - `attachment_name` (string, optional): Original file name.
  - `attachment_type` (string, optional): File type / MIME type.
  
  #### Response (201 Created)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": "msg-uuid",
      "room": "room-uuid",
      "content": "Hi there, I uploaded the requirements document.",
      "attachment_url": "https://cdn.gighub.ahsanull.com/user-id/general/1723456789-requirements.pdf",
      "attachment_name": "requirements.pdf",
      "attachment_type": "application/pdf",
      "created_at": "timestamp",
      "sender": {
        "id": "sender-uuid",
        "name": "Sender Name",
        "username": "sender",
        "email": "sender@example.com",
        "avatar": "url",
        "verified": true
      }
    },
    "message": "Message sent successfully"
  }
  ```
}
